From a70563242fdb8f962c80030d249bedac1e93d359 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 22:29:04 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add headless adapter entry point for the Zed editor

- src/zed/adapter.ts: resolves debug.json configs without the VS Code
  frontend and replaces the gdb-server console with DAP output events
- split the stock adapter entry into src/debugadapter-main.ts so gdb.ts
  can be imported without side effects
- mi2: don't treat a digits-only partial read (MI token) as console output;
  gdb 15 flushes the token separately which hung session start

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UStNUDdj88B9YWgFcwipyi
